{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/panel_hanging

    What hangs from the knob of a child, by the age of its course (panel::hanging_object): the backpack with the name on
    its label (mochila), the plainer backpack with a key ring and the name on its plate (llavero), or the luggage tag of
    cream card on its cord, with the name on the tag (equipaje). The three hang from the same knob and swing the same; a
    little crooked, each its own way. The three are drawn and the class of the svg shows one (pub/panel.css); without
    object, the backpack. A drawing only: the name is written beside it.

    Example context (json):
    {"name": "Leo", "style": "--reposo:-3.5deg", "object": "llavero"}
}}
